OL,5,G0930 ITV Racing: The Opening Show
OL,6,     FOli Bell and the team are at
OL,7,     FCheltenham ahead of a busy weekend
OL,8,     Fof racing over both the flat and
OL,9,     Fjumps.
OL,10,G1030 The Big Match Revisited
OL,11,     FBrian Moore introduces highlights
OL,12,     Ffrom September 1972 as Arsenal
OL,13,     Ftook on Liverpool, Wolverhampton
OL,14,     FWandererers played Manchester
OL,15,     FUnited and Sheffield United
OL,16,     Fentertained Chelsea.
