OL,10,     Faccused of killing him.
OL,11,G1710 The Protectors
OL,12,     FBalance of Terror: Europe-based
OL,13,     Fadventure series. The KGB hires
OL,14,     Fthe Protectors to capture a
OL,15,     Frenegade Russian scientist who
OL,16,     Fplans to unleash a biological
OL,17,     Fweapon on London.
