OL,5,G1740 The Best of the 70s
OL,6,     FA look back at the wide variety of
OL,7,     Fsports covered by ITV during the
OL,8,     F1970s - from horse racing to table
OL,9,     Ffootball and Formula One to darts
OL,10,     F- that includes many memorable
OL,11,     Fmoments.
OL,12,G1800 Darts: European Championship
OL,13,     FThe last 16 concludes at the
OL,14,     FEuropean Championship as four more
OL,15,     Fplayers book their places in
OL,16,     FSunday's quarter-finals.
